    "text": "21 hours ago Vilgain’s Double Trouble Protein Bar has given fans plenty of dessert-style experiences to choose from, with its layers allowing for more than just a flavored protein dough. Earlier this year, that included Peanut Butter & Raspberry Jelly, putting an actual fruity jelly alongside the decadent and smooth base. The Czech brand is exploring that combination of textures again in its newest extension to the top-tasting protein bar with Banana Jelly. Read full article",
